Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.95,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Any fool could have seen that\NNoah never planned to set us free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He claimed that doorway led back to the\Nreal world, but it was just another trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to go\Nstraight to the source and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,take down the man behind\Nall of this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My stepfather, Gozoboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If he thinks his ridiculous\Nplan to drag the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,world into this digital\Ndump is going to succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,then he's more senile than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that old fool is\Nsitting in my office right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken him down once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm planning to do it\Nagain, but this time for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That scrawny little dwerp\Ndouble-crossed us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we shouldn't have trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's toast. Wait, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to come up with\Na plan that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I already came up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We shake Noah upside down\Ntill he tells us the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to agree\Nwith Joey on this one, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Noah knows where the exit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because pretty soon, the\Nwhole world will be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't have trusted Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault. Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe there's still good inside of\NNoah, and there's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no one else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything he's done, it's\Nhard to believe he could change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, boys. Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid made us sniff at a dude, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's acts of rage are fueled\Nby an anger deep inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can help him see the\Nlight. I hope so. And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find Noah and\Nfigure out how to get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,out of here so we can\Nstop Gozoburo's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're free from cyberspace,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we can warn people in the real world that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozoburo's planning to\Ndigitize the planet. I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, I couldn't understand\Na thing you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost a chimp now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Skull Night!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are these monsters coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This should keep them busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, running\Naway was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Flame attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be back in\Nthe real world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's body was a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can move ahead with my plan and\Nstop my father from completing his.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Access confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Central Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy the central computer that\Nallows my father's virtual world to exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,thus destroying every\Nmind that's trapped there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's, Seto's, and\Nall of Yugi's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking I was actually going to help them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,escape was the last\Nmistake they'll ever make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The past is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take my father\Ndown with his own satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating satellite reprogramming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing for attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to my stepfather's\Nnonsense once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how to knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you never taught\Nme manners. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for a father and son chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, just give in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll make things much\Neasier on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or you can choose to meet the same fate\Nas your little friends. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My army of monsters is\Nabout to wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little threats don't scare me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you let us go\Nbefore I really get angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the perfect way to\Nsettle our differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recall the chess match\Nwe had the day I met you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I propose a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to play\Nchess against someone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,who couldn't even beat\Nme when I was just a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I'm talking about you\Nand I playing another chess game, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what did you have in mind, Gozaburo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a game you're quite fond of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd jump at the chance to\Nduel your stepfather to win your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought wrong, Gozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play with my\Nlife like it's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's exactly what you did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, on the day you stole\Nthe Kaiba Corporation from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How heartbreaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:07:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here because I outsmarted you and\Ntook away your precious little company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here because the virtual\Nworld gives me limitless power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll use it to digitize the\Nworld, but first I'll get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do you have to beat\Nme in a duel to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To humiliate you, like you humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I beat you at your favorite game,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you never\Nstand in my way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll erase your mind and\Nreprogram you as my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll obey my every command\Njust like the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never served anyone but myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never backed down from\Na challenge either, Gozoboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The satellite's almost\Nreprogrammed for destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find you, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that means\Nshutting this place down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Main power is offline!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Main power is offline!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was almost finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing magnetic dock! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no longer locked down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to find the\Nother passengers. Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to\Nhumiliate yourself, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And you criticized me\Nfor having no manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Painful Choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a magic card that allows\Nme to take any five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what the card does, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,First you show me any five cards from\Nyour deck, then I pick one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That card goes into your hand,\Nthe others head to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, show me your five cards already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, someone's feeling a bit anxious,\Nso feast your eyes on my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a strong feeling you've\Nencountered them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do these five cards seem familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not those cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the five pieces of\NExodia, the Forbidden One!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have all five pieces\Nof Exodia in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But not for long. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we've just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know all about your\Npainful history with Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your point. That's\Nhistory. Besides, I'm about
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,to send four pieces of\Nexodia to the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then what are you waiting for any\Nduelist holding all five pieces of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:10:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,exodia automatically wins but since\Nhe drew them using a painful choice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic card. I can send four of them\Nto the graveyard. Didn't I teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that hesitation is a form of weakness\Nwhen basing down your enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.77,0:10:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even he's not dumb enough to\Nthrow away his best cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you keep that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the right arm of Exodia goes\Nto my hand and the others go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place one monster in\Ndefense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't be long before\Nyou hear me say checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency backup generators activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All systems operating normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that satellite attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire virtual world will instantly\Nshut down along with every mind inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,An uninvited guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,30 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.91,0:11:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those monsters coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like we're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like our work's not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do our thing, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,25 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate virtual simulators.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find those fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite set to destroy central computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,23 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. Right, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally giving Kaivocorp to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You had your chance, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lied to me for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to make my escape\Nand leave those fools behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My father said he's bringing the\Nwhole world in here And that means
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never have to be alone again.\NWe'll be one big happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in danger, too, and we\Nall have to work together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Moki, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered, you can't escape with\Nus to the real world without a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I bet Seto can make you a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're our family, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I stop thinking about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, Noah,\Nwe are brothers, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After all I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Brotherhood, family, who needs it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my so-called family\Nwill be gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,21 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate virtual simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lackluster Soldier, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go, X-Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,18 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother believes in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop that satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The controls!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That intruder must have done all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Mokuba and the others are doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,15 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down and\Nsummon Force Raider in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be more powerful\Nthan my Force Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, knowing\NGo Zaburo, he's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his face down, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you put Exodia's\Nright arm on the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing now that I have what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Seto. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I activate the magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Contract with Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,i've never seen that\Ncard before what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,before i could activate\Nthis magic card i had to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,make sure that all five\Npieces of exodia were sent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to my card graveyard next\Ni'll give up 2 000 life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,points allowing me to\Nsummon exodia necros ah what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,on earth are you talking\Nabout settle it's over
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so prepare for defeat meet\Nthe most feared creature
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In duel monsters, the\Nmighty Exodia Necros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the last monster\Nyou'll ever see, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited years for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Check me, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, son, are you frightened? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your Exodia Necros\Nonly has 1,800 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and my monster's stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't judge a monster by its cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia Necros may be stronger\Nthan it appears, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia Necros, attack\Nhim now! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in the world are you attacking me with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster that is\Nclearly weaker than mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozoboro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,why is your monster still standing tell me\Nmy force raider should have destroyed it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it cannot be destroyed\Nby another monster and in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,addition it gains 1000\Nattack points whenever it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,engages in a battle oh\Nno are you beginning to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,understand that there's no\Nway you can win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia Necros is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, my\Nboy. Not quite. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He may think his Exodia can't\Nbe destroyed, but he's mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:17:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Spirit Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, say goodbye to your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate my Burst Breath Trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me sacrifice Spirit Ryu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,which destroys every monster on the field\Nwith fewer than 1,000 defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia Necros has zero defense\Npoints, so why wasn't it destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster is granted special effects from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,each of the five Exodia\Ncards in my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the left leg is in my graveyard,\Nno magic card can destroy Exodia Necros.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.55,0:17:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia's right leg protects my\Ncreature from all of your trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The left arm in my graveyard\Nensures that Exodia Necros
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,is protected from the special\Neffects of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:18:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia's right arm allows my creature to\Ngain 1,000 attack points with every battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Having the head of Exodia in\Nmy graveyard protects my beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,from being destroyed by any\Nof your monsters in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The five pieces of Exodia are even powerful\Nwhen they're sent to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't destroy his Exodia necros\Nwith monster, magic, or trap cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well give up and admit defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be beaten by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down and switch\NForce Raider into defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning, 10 minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate all virtual simulators now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fry this creep, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:18:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Invincible Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can all of you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is extremely important!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice. Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get down\Nhere, you little twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a warning to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the virtual world that you're\Nall in is about to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we couldn't trust him, but I\Nnever thought he'd destroy this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk, I'll give him the\Nvirtual butt-kicking of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You better let us out of here, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, ho, ho, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for the\Nway I treated you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But now a satellite is set to\Ndestroy the main computer system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When that computer shuts down,\Nthe virtual world will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You must escape or your\Nminds will be lost forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Beginning destruction sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Targeting central computer hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
